UID:10004703-1785850200-1785853800@jccmetrowest.org
SUMMARY:Salsa for Life Workshop
DESCRIPTION:This program is designed by salsa aficionado\, Maria Andrew\, CDP. Salsa for Life is designed with seniors in mind\, to be enjoyed by all who are able to dance or for those who simply want to enjoy the music. The goal of the class is to create mindfulness\, to increase blood flow and energy\, and to create a positive atmosphere. Enjoy the time to smile\, laugh\, dance and to encourage each other to enjoy life. \nFree and open to all.\nAdvanced registration required. \nRegister Here\n 
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/salsa-workshop/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Tepper Hall\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/salsa-for-life.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Ellen Robertson":MAILTO:erobertson@jccmetrowest.org
GEO:40.7674616;-74.2963088
