SUMMARY:J-Films: Summer Lovin' Film Series
DESCRIPTION:Beat the heat and have a chance to meet new people\, all while enjoying 2 classic movies!\nCome before the film (doors open at 7pm) for mocktails\, snacks and fun.  Screenings start at 8pm. \nDoors Open: 7pm\nFilm Starts: 8pm \nTickets: $12/person (one film) | $20/person (both films)\nTickets will also be on sale at the door with cash or check. \nPurchase Tickets\nCelebrate Tu B’Av\, the Jewish festival of love\, with your JCC community! \nLearn more about Tu B’Av here. \n  \n\nDirty Dancing\nWednesday\, July 29\nBaby falls for charismatic dance instructor Johnny during a life-changing summer in the Catskills.\n100 minutes • English with English subtitles \n  \n \nThe Apartment\nWednesday\, August 12\nA sweet-and-sour romance meets sharp corporate satire in Billy Wilder’s 1960 Best Picture classic.\n125 minutes • English with English subtitles\n \n  \nFILM TRAILERS: \n \n 
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/j-films-summer-lovin-film-series-2/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:JFilms
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/JFilms27_SummerLovin_Hero.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Stuart Weinstock":MAILTO:sweinstock@jccmetrowest.org
GEO:40.7674616;-74.2963088
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=JCC MetroWest | Maurice Levin Theater 760 Northfield Ave West Orange NJ 07052 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=760 Northfield Ave:geo:-74.2963088,40.7674616
END:VEVENT
