SUMMARY:Ultimate Family Pool Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Perfect for children\, teens\, adults\, and families of all ages. Everyone is welcome to join the fun! \nFREE for Members \nNonmembers:\nAges 13 and up: $5 • Under 13: $3\nRegistration required \nHighlights: \n\nFloating Card Games\nGiant Floating Connect Four\nTeam Challenges\nPool Volleyball\nUnderwater Football\nFloating Basketball\nAnd much more!\n\nREGISTER HERE\n  \nQuestions? Contact the Aquatics Department at aquaticsdept@jccmetrowest.org
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/family-pool-game-night/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Pool\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
