SUMMARY:Dive-In Movie
DESCRIPTION:Family Fun at the Pool!\nEnjoy an afternoon of swimming and family fun while watching a movie from the pool. Bring your floats and enjoy a unique movie experience from the water with family and friends. \n\nThe Goonies\nSunday\, July 26 \nFREE for Members\nNonmembers:\nAges 13 and up: $5 • Under 13: $3 \n  \nJaws\nSunday\, August 16\nFREE for all! \n  \nHighlights: \n\nBig screen poolside movie viewing\nFun pool floats and noodles\nFamily-friendly environment\nStay for Family Splash Time after the movie!\n\n  \nRegistration required \nREGISTER HERE\n  \nQuestions? Contact the Aquatics Department at aquaticsdept@jccmetrowest.org
URL:https://jccmetrowest.org/event/dive-in-movie-3-2/
LOCATION:JCC MetroWest | Pool\, 760 Northfield Ave\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Aquatics
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jccmetrowest.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Dive-In-Movie-FY25_hero.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Aquatics Department":MAILTO:aquaticsdept@jccmetrowest.org
END:VEVENT
